      ],
      "en": "My heart is severely pained within me. The terrors of death have fallen on me.",
      "ko": "내 마음이 내 속에서 심히 아파하며 사망의 위험이 내게 미쳤도다",
      "source_text_hash": "392c8d27cde3b9070aeb8979b48f1c77f5de70fb82115ed16525d85e52ad998a",
      "translation_text_hash": "eeb45c157f6ad0fdb7b7e69e53a20fba66c3f5d25c1903be0baf1c17f5a56d0d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
