      ],
      "en": "Fearfulness and trembling have come on me. Horror has overwhelmed me.",
      "ko": "두려움과 떨림이 내게 이르고 황공함이 나를 덮었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "60d35352dcf6eadd26f2f25d65a255ae171364c1c7684d74d4205647e89c84d7",
      "translation_text_hash": "f607ec41437cb1ca6215d0fa340582de93a3413b0c4655eed41db8a62f1a2732",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
