      "en": "I said, “Oh that I had wings like a dove! Then I would fly away, and be at rest.",
      "ko": "나의 말이 내가 비둘기 같이 날개가 있으면 날아가서 편히 쉬리로다",
      "source_text_hash": "8edc485a00b7d56b4d7a4f7eda8b62019886ff4d16fc88f212bbe18f62cadcc5",
      "translation_text_hash": "cf7958abdbd463fcbf7abcdba411c5578520c3a18ba95e9b3cf290728a597eb0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
