      "en": "For it was not an enemy who insulted me, then I could have endured it. Neither was it he who hated me who raised himself up against me, then I would have hidden myself from him.",
      "ko": "나를 책망한 자가 원수가 아니라 원수일찐대 내가 참았으리라 나를 대하여 자기를 높이는 자가 나를 미워하는 자가 아니라 미워하는 자일찐대 내가 그를 피하여 숨었으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "23d3f3ff58ec85fe202e96a5ad93b8d049269805232395a3389f624b71997889",
      "translation_text_hash": "9d2beab8d72a0599d458118d46a54002b01ffd4f900ba2797f9ffaf162ddb737",
